  <p>Prashnottar is an independent exam-practice platform. We are not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to BPSC, MPPSC, RPSC, BSEB, CBSE, CG Vyapam, the Chhattisgarh Staff Selection Board or any government body. Exam dates and patterns shown on the site are tentative; the official notice is always final.</p>
