  <h2>5. Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Packs are for your personal use. You may not copy, share, resell, upload or distribute our questions, papers or PDFs, including on Telegram or WhatsApp groups. Printed papers carry a watermark and may be traced to an account. We may suspend accounts that break this rule without a refund.</p>
